  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Hello. I really need your help.",
      "",
      "It is very hard to manufacture C-stone",
      "from specimens that are brought by ",
      "Royal Mages. The problem is we have many broken ",
      "pieces from unsuccessful manufacturing.",
      "",
      "Even though these are broken pieces of C-stone,",
      "they still retain evil power. These can become",
      "objects of evil. These need to be thrown away before",
      "this happens. ",
      "",
      "Help me to discard these broken pieces. ",
      "This is very urgent!!!"
    ]
  },
